Apple today released <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macos-26/">macOS Tahoe</a> 26.3.1, a minor update to the &zwnj;macOS Tahoe&zwnj; operating system that came out last September. &zwnj;macOS Tahoe&zwnj; 26.3.1 comes three weeks after Apple <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/02/11/apple-releases-macos-tahoe-26-3/">launched macOS Tahoe 26.3</a>.<br/>
<br/>
